import{_ as t,o as n,c as o,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 430 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Swallowing Starry Sky Linkage: Setting Contradictions and Retcon of a Two-Book Saga","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 430 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Swallowing Starry Sky Linkage: Setting Contradictions and Retcon of a Two-Book Saga","no":430,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Swallowing Starry Sky","Two-Book Linkage","Setting Contradiction","Retcon"],"related":["97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table","99-Document Version and Maintenance Note","80-Plane Theory and Classification"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0430_模块2-莽荒纪-吞噬星空联动-两部曲的设定矛盾与吃书.md","filePath":"en/0430_模块2-莽荒纪-吞噬星空联动-两部曲的设定矛盾与吃书.md"}'),a={name:"en/0430_模块2-莽荒纪-吞噬星空联动-两部曲的设定矛盾与吃书.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,g,c){return n(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-430-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-swallowing-starry-sky-linkage-setting-contradictions-and-retcon-of-a-two-book-saga" tabindex="-1">Entry 430 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Swallowing Starry Sky Linkage: Setting Contradictions and Retcon of a Two-Book Saga <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-430-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-swallowing-starry-sky-linkage-setting-contradictions-and-retcon-of-a-two-book-saga" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 430 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Swallowing Starry Sky Linkage: Setting Contradictions and Retcon of a Two-Book Saga&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 35) | Benchmark base: Documents 97, 99, 80</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-two-novels-each-valid-twisted-into-one-cosmos-that-undermines-itself" tabindex="-1">Introduction: two novels each valid, twisted into one cosmos that undermines itself <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-two-novels-each-valid-twisted-into-one-cosmos-that-undermines-itself" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: two novels each valid, twisted into one cosmos that undermines itself&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> is the mirror here — never retcon. <em>Manghuang Ji</em> and <em>Swallowing Starry Sky</em> are both I-Eat-Tomatoes works; late they are forcibly compiled into the same cosmos model. This entry specifically dissects the two-book linkage&#39;s setting contradictions. This is Entry 403&#39;s &quot;retcon-ending analysis&quot; deepened version. The law-first axiom is core. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = high-leaning-medium. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Two-book linkage&#39;s energy waste is mutual depreciation of two worldviews&#39; trust: the cosmos model Manghuang readers believed is covered by Swallowing Starry Sky&#39;s new model; the rules Swallowing Starry Sky readers are familiar with are clashed by Manghuang&#39;s old setting. <strong>Early worldview trust is bidirectionally consumed in linkage.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How linkage retcon manufactures regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Cosmos model redrawn</strong>: Manghuang&#39;s &quot;cosmos&quot; shrinks to a corner of a larger model; early &quot;cosmos-tier&quot; devalued</li><li><strong>Law systems mutually exclusive</strong>: Manghuang&#39;s cultivation laws and Swallowing Starry Sky&#39;s martial-artist/thought-form laws originally incompatible; forced merger makes rules fuzzy</li><li><strong>Protagonist positions rearranged</strong>: Ji Ning and Luo Feng&#39;s tier relationship repeatedly adjusted with linkage needs</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Behind linkage is the author&#39;s monopoly of &quot;IP defining right&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Merge to continue writing</strong>: two-book linkage is essentially IP operation; for popularity does not hesitate to overturn early</li><li><strong>Protagonist always right</strong>: Ji Ning and Luo Feng in the new model must both be strong; old supporting characters&#39; fates casually rewritten</li><li><strong>Readers treated as stock</strong>: readers&#39; emotional investment in old setting treated as consumable asset</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Two-Book Linkage Retcon</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Version Management</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Forced merger, rules mutually exclusive</td><td>Document version and maintenance note: setting traceable, not overturned</td></tr><tr><td>Cosmos model redrawn</td><td>Plane theory and classification: classification legislated first</td></tr><tr><td>Law systems mutually exclusive</td><td>Setting-contradiction self-check table: new setting first passes self-consistency check</td></tr><tr><td>Old foreshadowing rewritten</td><td>Version management: new dimensions join as appendix</td></tr><tr><td>Self-consistency sacrificed for popularity</td><td>Reality-as-foundation: setting serves logic, not business</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: build a &quot;rule-conflict matrix&quot; between Manghuang&#39;s law system and Swallowing Starry Sky&#39;s law system</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: compare &quot;forced merger,&quot; &quot;independent cosmoses each ended,&quot; &quot;shared framework under version management&quot; three linkages</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: rule-conflict points, early foreshadowing survival rate, reader trust</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — forced merger has most conflict points, lowest foreshadowing survival; version management lets two books share a framework without undermining each other</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Post-linkage self-consistency: low</strong>. Two law systems mutually exclusive; cannot both hold</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extremely high</strong>. Multi-book linkage is web-literature&#39;s retcon disaster area</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high-leaning-medium</strong>. Post-linkage Ji Ning&#39;s peak status relies on author&#39;s redefinition</li></ul><p>Two-book linkage also has a technical lesson: different systems&#39; cosmos models cannot be hard-welded. Manghuang&#39;s cosmos is cultivation-style, law-style; Swallowing Starry Sky&#39;s is physical, energy-style. Two models&#39; bottom assumptions differ; forced merger inevitably produces unsolvable problems like &quot;what tier is a cultivator.&quot; The reason Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s plane theory is expandable is that from the start it defines all planes with the same rule framework — new planes are filled in, not welded on. Framework unified first, expansion does not fight.</p><p>Two-book linkage also reminds us: cosmos size is not important; rule self-consistency is. Manghuang&#39;s cosmos drawn however large, rules not self-consistent are still an empty map. Heng Yuan Zhou would rather the cosmos smaller, but every rule stands.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: two worldviews&#39; trust mutually depreciated</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: readers&#39; emotional investment treated as consumable stock</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo system is self-contained in one realm, not merged with others; Manghuang&#39;s retcon is cross-work tier</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: post-linkage Myriad-Ranks position even more chaotic</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: looks like cross-work expansion, actually crashes every cross</li></ul><p>Two-book linkage also exposes an industry ailment: writing the cosmos bigger and bigger, thinking this is vision. Manghuang&#39;s cosmos from Three Realms to Chaos Immortal Realm to larger cosmos, actually only changed a bigger backdrop; bottom rules unmoved. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s expansion is the opposite — it adds new planes, new races, new institutions, not simply blowing up the cosmos. Vision is not how big the cosmos is, but how many different worlds the rules can contain.</p><p>Rule self-consistency matters more than cosmos size. Manghuang&#39;s lesson: draw the cosmos however big, rules not self-consistent are still an unfolded empty map.</p><p>This is the first lesson multi-book linkage must relearn under Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s framework.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Multi-book linkage is not the original sin; the original sin is doing linkage without version management. Manghuang and Swallowing Starry Sky&#39;s collision tells us: the more the worldview wants to be big, the more it must first nail &quot;rules must not be casually overturned.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s approach is plain — new dimensions all via appendix, old setting not a character changed.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · Swallowing Starry Sky linkage · setting contradictions and retcon of a two-book saga described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./429_模块2-莽荒纪-因果自律缺失-穿越者与因果扰动.html">Entry 429 · Causal Self-Discipline Absence</a> · <a href="./403_模块2-莽荒纪-吃书烂尾分析-后期设定推翻与吞噬星空联动矛盾.html">Entry 403 · Retcon-Ending Analysis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const m=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{u as __pageData,m as default};
